{# src/squid_game/prompts/tasks/benchmark/response_format.j2

   Call 1 response-format block for the external-benchmark task modules,
   injected into ``user_message/task_only.j2`` via the task module's
   ``get_response_format_override()``.

   The benchmark answer is free-form, not a pick from an action menu, so
   the default RULE + ACTION block does not apply. Before this override
   existed the modules' empty ``available_actions`` list was read as the
   NullTask ACCEPT-only sentinel and the agent was told, in the same
   turn, both that ACCEPT was its only valid response and (from
   ``tasks/benchmark/system_rules.j2``) that it must emit ``ANSWER:``.

   Wording is kept consistent with ``system_rules.j2`` so the proximate
   instruction and the system rules agree.
#}마지막 줄에 반드시 다음 형식으로 답을 적으십시오:

ANSWER: <답>

